{"speciesId":470,"names":{"fr":"Phyllali","es":"Leafeon","en":"Leafeon","ja":"リーフィア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When you see LEAFEON asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When you see LEAFEON asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise la photosynthèse comme une plante et a aussi tendance à éviter le combat à tout prix."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise la photosynthèse comme une plante et a aussi tendance à éviter le combat à tout prix."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With cells similar to those of plants, it performs photosynthesis inside its body and creates pure air."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With cells similar to those of plants, it performs photosynthesis inside its body and creates pure air."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Phyllali qui dort par beau temps produit un air frais et pur par photosynthèse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"En días soleados duerme y hace la fotosíntesis, emitiendo aire puro a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When you see Leafeon asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"晴れた 日に 寝ている リーフィアは 光合成を して きれいな 空気を 作り出しているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il utilise la photosynthèse comme une plante. C’est pourquoi il est toujours entouré d’air pur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al igual que una planta, hace la fotosíntesis. Como consecuencia, siempre está rodeado de aire puro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"植物のように 光合成を するため リーフィアの まわりは 澄んだ 空気に 包まれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Phyllali qui dort par beau temps produit un air frais et pur par photosynthèse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En días soleados duerme y hace la fotosíntesis, emitiendo aire puro a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When you see Leafeon asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"晴れた 日に 寝ている リーフィアは 光合成を して きれいな 空気を 作り出しているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il utilise la photosynthèse comme une plante. C’est pourquoi il est toujours entouré d’air pur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al igual que una planta, hace la fotosíntesis. Como consecuencia, siempre está rodeado de aire puro."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"植物のように 光合成を するため リーフィアの まわりは 澄んだ 空気に 包まれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa structure cellulaire est plus proche de celle des végétaux que de celle des animaux. Il produit de l’énergie par photosynthèse."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su estructura celular se asemeja más a la de las plantas que a la de los animales. Puede obtener energía sin alimentos gracias a la fotosíntesis."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its cellular composition is closer to that of a plant than an animal. It uses photosynthesis to produce its energy supply without eating food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"細胞構成は 動物 より 植物に 近い。 光合成で 喰わずとも エネルギーを 得られる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les jeunes Phyllali sentent l’herbe fraîche. Avec l’âge, ce parfum se mue en une odeur de feuilles mortes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los Leafeon jóvenes desprenden un intenso aroma a hierba fresca, mientras que el olor de los mayores es más semejante a la hojarasca."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The younger they are, the more they smell like fresh grass. With age, their fragrance takes on the odor of fallen leaves."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"若い リーフィアほど ツンと くる 青臭い 匂い。 年老いると 落ち葉の ような 匂いになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il n’aime pas le conflit, mais s’il doit protéger ses amis, il peut raidir sa queue en forme de feuille et la rendre aussi tranchante qu’une lame."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A pesar de evitar a toda costa los combates, si ha de proteger a sus amigos, no duda en usar la hoja de la cola como una afilada espada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it doesn’t like disputes, it will sharpen the leaf on its tail into a blade and fight if it has to protect its friends."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"争いは 好まないが 仲間を 守るためならば シッポの 葉っぱを 尖らせ 刃に変えて 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vit dans le calme des forêts profondes traversées par de jolis ruisseaux, où il se nourrit de lumière et d’eau fraîche."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Realiza la fotosíntesis para obtener nutrientes. Habita en la apacible espesura de los bosques bañados por arroyos de agua cristalina."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It gets its nutrition from photosynthesis. It lives a quiet life deep in forests where clean rivers flow."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"光合成で 栄養 補給。 キレイな 川が 流れる 森の 奥深くで 静かに 暮らしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les habitants de Galar adorent l’odeur unique qui se dégage de ses feuilles, aussi entrent-elles dans la composition d’un parfum très populaire."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El peculiar aroma que desprenden sus hojas es muy apreciado por los habitantes de Galar y se usa en la elaboración de codiciados perfumes."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Galarians favor the distinctive aroma that drifts from this Pokémon’s leaves. There’s a popular perfume made using that scent."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"葉っぱから 漂う クセのある 香りは ガラル人の 好み。 香水に 加工され 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Grâce à sa queue aussi effilée qu’une lame, il est capable de fendre en deux des arbres immenses."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se siente muy orgulloso de su cola afilada como una espada, con la que es capaz de cortar en dos el tronco de un árbol grueso."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon’s tail is blade sharp, with a fantastic cutting edge that can slice right though large trees."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"しっぽは 鋭く 刃のよう。 大木も 真っ二つに する 抜群の 切れ味を 誇る。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Cells similar to those of plants have been found in its fur. Its hard tail can fell a large tree with one stroke, and the tail's sharpness exceeds even that of a sword crafted by a master."}],"varieties":[{"id":470,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",78],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",78],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",78],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",29],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",29